WEBVTT

00:03:27.288 --> 00:03:31.621
only 60 percent of eligible Americans
actually voted.

00:03:33.121 --> 00:03:36.746
Over 100 million people

00:03:36.788 --> 00:03:38.871
did not vote in 2016.

00:03:39.621 --> 00:03:41.954
And when they were surveyed as to why,

00:03:43.538 --> 00:03:47.288
over 40 percent indicated
it was due to a barrier:

00:03:47.288 --> 00:03:48.496
missing a deadline,

00:03:48.538 --> 00:03:49.913
couldn't get off work,

00:03:49.954 --> 00:03:51.954
couldn't wait in line for hours.

00:03:52.704 --> 00:03:55.829
If "did not vote" was
on the ballot in 2016,

00:03:55.871 --> 00:03:58.204
"did not vote" would have won
in a landslide.

00:03:58.996 --> 00:04:03.579
What we end up with is a system
where a minority of eligible Americans